            <ArticleTitle>Myoclonic spasms following intrathecal morphine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>389-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Myoclonic twitching in the lower limbs of a patient who received intrathecal narcotics is described. There was no loss of consciousness. Reports of this phenomenon in animals are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
